+   - `agencies` (slug PK: `hit`, `suite`) + **`audit_logs`** (diseño ADR-011: `organization_id`, `actor_id`, `actor_email`, `actor_type`, `action`, `entity_type`, `entity_id`, `request_id`, `created_at` + `metadata jsonb` before/after) + RLS (staff SELECT).
+   - `rate_tables` + `rate_rows` por organización (reusa enum `billing_freight_type` AIR/MAR; `price`/`cost`; profit/margin **no stored** — se computan en Worker `domain/calc`).
